    "what_en": "After install, Claude generates hierarchical AGENTS.md files in a repo: one at the root plus one per complexity-scored subdirectory, documenting structure, commands, and conventions. It reads existing AGENTS.md files first.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when you run /init-deep, or when a repo needs its structure, commands, and conventions documented for agents.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "/init-deep generate AGENTS.md for this repo",
        "note": "Updates existing files, creates new ones where warranted"
      },
      {
        "text": "/init-deep --create-new regenerate everything from scratch",
        "note": "Reads existing files, removes all, rebuilds"
      },
      {
        "text": "/init-deep --max-depth=2 limit depth to two levels",
